# Agent skills installed via `npx skills add`. Third-party files that land inside
# the repo (the installer targets the cwd, so they appear at the root OR under
# site/ depending on where it was run). They are tooling for whoever is editing
# the site, not part of the site, so keep them out of a routine `git add -A`.
.claude/skills/
.agents/skills/
skills-lock.json

# Large video master (compressed 4.6MB version ships in site/public/; keep the 209MB 4K master local only)
video-source/
